[thin] This isolated 0.189 mm diagonal ends at the finite top edge of the flute backing where it meets the crown's inner curve. Exact CAD traces inward from that curved face for 3.000 mm and from the adjacent backing plane for 3.699 mm. The diagonal measures proximity to the end boundary; it is not the section of a 0.189 mm wall.
alternatives: Extending the backing above Z21 moves this end boundary into the crown and adds material outside the texture field. Making the full flank 4.2 mm thick removes the local pad end with additional stock in unfluted areas and less interior access.
