alternatives: Extending each stop outboard covers this end-plane junction with additional stop stock beyond the motion stop plane. A 4 mm shell adds material and narrows the cavity; enlarging the outside to preserve that cavity increases the reference object's size. Filling the curved boundary with square stock removes part of the retained curve from view.
